note right of EntryTest
  If no active EntryTest exists yet, EntryTestServiceImpl lazily
  creates a default "Software Engineer Entry Test" the first time
  a candidate starts a test (getOrCreateActiveEntryTest)
end note

class "EntryTest.EntryTestSectionConfig" as EntryTestSectionConfig {
  - sectionType : EntryTest.SectionType
